If you are reading this - this INSTALL covers the native systems (defined in ./COMPAT)

GNU+Linux/UNIX-like/HaikuOS:
	Install SDL1.2 library across your device with a package manager.
	Linux (Ubuntu):
		sudo apt install libsdl1.2-dev
	HaikuOS:
		pkgman install libsdl
	Install make and gcc (Should be preinstalled)
	Run 'make'
	The executable will be called 'Pong.out'

Windows:
	As I have not tried compiling this on windows, you will need a linux machine. Follow the last section until it says 'run make'
	So.. you just have to run 'make win_9x_DOS' and the executable will be called 'Pong_w95_i386.exe' because the executable is 32 bit so it will run on any windows system.
